* The sender shall generate the list of acceptable clock classes. The list shall be sorted in descending order. Each accepted Clock Class value shall appear only once in the list. Depending on implementation, the receiver may interpret the list in either of two ways: 
    * a\) use only the first \(i.e. the maximum\) item in the list, interpreting it as a threshold value for acceptable clock classes, while ignoring all other items in the list;
    * b\) use the whole list, interpreting it as an explicit list of acceptable clock classes.

